{{Burst|After Your Life is Decreased}}
 Destroy an opposing 4000 BP or less Spirit. Then, by paying the cost, activate this card's Main effect.

 Main - Draw 2 cards from your deck. Then, reveal a card from your decktop. If that card is a Red Spirit card, add it to your hand. Otherwise, return it to your decktop.

{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
If you control any White Spirit, summon this Spirit card.

[LV1][LV2][LV3] {{ha|∞}}
This Spirit is unaffected by opposing Spirit/Brave/Nexus/Magic effects with the same color(s) as the symbols on the opposing Field.

[LV2][LV3] (When Battles)
When this Spirit destroys any opposing Spirit, return to the Hand all opposing Spirits with same family as the destroyed Spirit, except for the destroyed Spirit.
